<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>The World's Most Valuable Companies in 2025 - Infographic</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    background: #0a0e17;
    color: #e0e0e0;
    font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .poster {
    width: 800px;
    background: #0a0e17;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 48px 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d1525 0%, #0a0e17 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a2540;
  }
  .hero-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #4fc3f7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .hero-stat {
    font-size: 86px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }
  .hero-stat-unit {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #4fc3f7;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .hero-company {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffd54f;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #8892b0;
    margin-top: 20px;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .hero-divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4fc3f7, #ffd54f);
    margin: 24px auto 0;
  }
  .section {
    padding: 40px 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a2540;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #4fc3f7;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #8892b0;
    margin-top: -20px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .infographic-container {
    width: 100%;
  }
  .chart-bar { height: 600px; }
  .chart-pie { height: 340px; }
  .list-grid { height: 320px; }
  .compare-section { height: 420px; }
  .footer {
    padding: 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .footer-stat-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    gap: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .footer-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .footer-stat-value {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }
  .footer-stat-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #8892b0;
    margin-top: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .footer-stat .accent {
    color: #ffd54f;
  }
  .footer-stat .accent-blue {
    color: #4fc3f7;
  }
  .footer-divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4fc3f7, #ffd54f);
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
  }
  .source-note {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #546e7a;
    margin-top: 32px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="poster" id="poster">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-label">The World's Most Valuable Companies &bull; 2025</div>
    <div class="hero-stat">$4.82<span class="hero-stat-unit">T</span></div>
    <div class="hero-company">NVIDIA &mdash; #1 Most Valuable Company</div>
    <div class="hero-subtitle">A comparative snapshot of the top publicly traded companies by market capitalization. A handful of U.S. tech giants command a staggering share of global market value.</div>
    <div class="hero-divider"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- TRILLION-DOLLAR CLUB -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">The Trillion-Dollar Club</div>
    <div class="section-subtitle">Eleven companies have crossed the trillion-dollar threshold. The top five alone are worth over $18.5T &mdash; roughly 13% of all tracked public company value.</div>
    <div class="infographic-container chart-bar" id="container-bar"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- COUNTRY DOMINANCE -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Country &amp; Regional Dominance</div>
    <div class="section-subtitle">Of the 20 largest companies, 15 are headquartered in the United States. The remaining five span four countries.</div>
